Alice's certificate.

122
00:07:38,180 --> 00:07:39,590
Now, we can trust that

123
00:07:39,590 --> 00:07:41,930
the certificate
hasn't been modified.

124
00:07:41,930 --> 00:07:43,640
Bob can trust that
this certificate

125
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:45,260
hasn't been modified as

126
00:07:45,260 --> 00:07:49,920
long as it has and trusts
the CA's public key.

127
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:53,720
Now, with that little
