135
00:08:26,015 --> 00:08:29,015
they have this
business relationship

136
00:08:29,015 --> 00:08:32,555
so they can verify the identity.

137
00:08:32,555 --> 00:08:37,205
They are well known
group of them and then

138
00:08:37,205 --> 00:08:41,885
we can trust them and
things like that.

139
00:08:41,885 --> 00:08:49,355
Here, the identity, the digital
certificate part contains

140
00:08:49,355 --> 00:08:52,160
the IP prefix the AS

141
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:57,990
origin and it ties it to
the owner's public key.

142
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:01,715
The whole architecture looks

143
00:09:01,715 --> 00:09:05,310
something like this and we'll
