144
00:09:05,370 --> 00:09:08,965
Starting, the first part is

145
00:09:08,965 --> 00:09:15,265
the IP owners create their
public private key pair,

146
00:09:15,265 --> 00:09:19,390
then they create a digital
certificate request,

147
00:09:19,390 --> 00:09:23,290
and send that to the
regional Internet registry.

148
00:09:23,290 --> 00:09:24,880
Again, they already
have a business

149
00:09:24,880 --> 00:09:26,950
relationship and you go to

150
00:09:26,950 --> 00:09:31,735
