shown here is an example.

151
00:09:31,735 --> 00:09:34,495
Just fill out some form,

152
00:09:34,495 --> 00:09:38,140
and that takes you
to the next step.

153
00:09:38,140 --> 00:09:41,425
That's making that request with

154
00:09:41,425 --> 00:09:43,105
your public key and

155
00:09:43,105 --> 00:09:46,100
the identity and all
that information.

156
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:50,445
The regional Internet registry,

157
00:09:50,445 --> 00:09:53,915
validates that identity
and the ownership

158
00:09:53,915 --> 00:09:57,970
and stores a resource
