172
00:10:47,650 --> 00:10:51,115
out there like Routinator
is an example,

173
00:10:51,115 --> 00:10:56,920
or open source or just
widely available.

174
00:10:56,920 --> 00:11:00,910
Then so we can download
this database,

175
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:02,500
verify all the signatures.

176
00:11:02,500 --> 00:11:09,745
Now, locally it has a list
