the prefix state.

188
00:11:50,835 --> 00:11:54,185
Now, it could be
in a valid state,

189
00:11:54,185 --> 00:11:56,260
meaning that as part of this

190
00:11:56,260 --> 00:11:59,710
it's found the prefix
