197
00:12:22,135 --> 00:12:24,385
Then it could also be unknown,

198
00:12:24,385 --> 00:12:28,105
which is if this prefix
isn't in the database.

199
00:12:28,105 --> 00:12:31,390
This is to keep with,
backwards compatibility,

200
00:12:31,390 --> 00:12:33,250
because the Internet
is not going to

201
00:12:33,250 --> 00:12:36,505
