202
00:12:36,505 --> 00:12:37,960
It's going to take a process

203
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:40,675
of years and years and years.

204
00:12:40,675 --> 00:12:44,080
It's already been over a decade,

205
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:46,135
and we still don't have

206
00:12:46,135 --> 00:12:50,360
all the routers
